  Description: "Modifies the spell\u2019s behavior depending on the equipped Cast
    Rune. Each Bounce Rune equipped accumulates effects.\n\r\nProjectile Cast - Bounces
    up to 3 times per Bounce Rune.\n\r\nDash Cast - While dashing, enemy projectiles
    are deflected. +1 per rune.\r\n\nShield Cast - Reflects enemy projectiles back
    to enemies. +1 per rune.\r"
